  "question": {
    "text": "If <math><mi>θ</mi></math> is the angle between the pair of tangents drawn to the ellipse <math><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math> from the point <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1,2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math> then the value of&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>tan</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>θ</mi></math> is equal to"
  },
